Z||000000||PAUL88GT||03-05-2001||06:02 PM||||Can anyone provide the part number and vendor for these items:<P>Distributor o-ring: local Autozone and Advanced Auto Part did not stock this item<P>EGR tube: need part number and vendor with best price.<P>Car is 86SE V6.<P>TIA<BR>Paul<p>[This message has been edited by PAUL88GT (edited 03-05-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrfiero||03-05-2001||06:28 PM||||Paul,<P>I have a nice used EGR tube for an '88 Fiero......LMK if you are interested (e-mail me for a price).<P>As far as the O ring......try NAPA or any other big parts place.  You can also go to the dealer......they should have these in stock.<P>I'll be out of town for a few days, but will still check my e-mail.||||reg||10
Z||000002||Old Lar||03-05-2001||09:29 PM||||EGR pipe kit is part # 10137017.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.gmpartsdirect.com" TARGET=_blank>www.gmpartsdirect.com</A>  has them for $47.88 plus shipping.  List for $79.||||reg||1
Z||000003||mrfiero||03-05-2001||11:05 PM||||Ooops! I didn't fully read your post.......I thought you needed it for a '88 (since your handle is Paul88GT).<P>The EGR pipes are different and while you can still make an '88 tube work on an '86 it would be best to just get the proper one to begin with.<P>Give gmpartsdirect a try.  Low prices, but the shipping stinks ($8.88 minimum shipping charge!)<P>   ||||reg||1
Z||000004||skitime||03-06-2001||08:14 AM||||I replaced mine with a O-ring from the hardware store.  Only 45 cents. It is a 1 1/8" outside diameter by 1/8" thick. It is working fine.  Just remember to scribe the distributer to get it back without retiming the engine. ||||reg||1
Z||000005||Will||03-06-2001||10:23 AM||||I just replaced my distributor o-ring this past weekend. I used a generic ring from the local Carquest place. The old ring was so hard is sounded like metal when I dropped it.<P>IRM sells a nice EGR tube with a braided stainless steel outside layer. Don't rmember how much right off, though.||||reg||1
Z||000006||c m west||03-06-2001||06:27 PM||||Unfortunatly, both of these items are available through a dealer only, however I happen to have some O-Rings laying here in my inventory and can get you a replacement EGR tube<P>Eric - West Coast Fiero / <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> ||||reg||1
